~ first_fill
Coren lowers the bucket and fills his bottles with cold, clean water.
[color=#E8C66A]Empty bottles can be filled with more than water.[/color]
[color=#E8C66A]Wells, springs, cauldrons, barrels... keep an eye out for anything worth bottling.[/color]
[color=#E8C66A]Bottles are hard to come by. Keep every one you find.[/color]
=> END
